Subject: [PATCH 331/913] dts: stm32: add SERC node in stm32mp211.dtsi

Add SERC node in stm32mp211.dtsi.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [ST downstream https://github.com/STMicroelectronics/optee_os.git 3e680c87aed89b1b5dfc2c443e24021f526e1a77 dts: stm32: add SERC node in stm32mp211.dtsi]
